1
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:01,620
Cześć!

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:04,660
Excuse me, how do I get from here to the sea?

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,140
I thought that in Wrocław there's only rivers, canals, islands and bridges.

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,740
I never thought that we also have a beach.

5
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:20,720
Well, just in the middle of the city there is an artificial beach called Morskie Oko,

6
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,860
which, in translation from Polish, means the eye of the sea.

7
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:29,340
It is an amazing place with lots of grass and sand,

8
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:34,020
a volleyball court and tennis courts.

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:39,480
And in the summertime you can just come with your beach towel

10
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:45,180
and enjoy an amazing time here at the beach of Morskie Oko.

11
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,440
I recommend coming here in the summer,

12
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:51,680
but it is beautiful also in the autumn.

13
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:57,100
Instead of people you will find ducks and swans

14
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:00,420
swimming in the lake. So see you soon

15
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,840
on our next video. Do widzenia!
